{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/","folio-assistant-sci":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-sci/v0/ns/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-substrate-parameter","@type":["folio-assistant-sci:Definition","doco:Section"],"label":"def:substrate-parameter","kind":"definition","title":"Substrate parameter","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-categorical-reeb"],"examples":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/ex-substrate-parameter-su2"],"cites":["references/lusztig1993"],"tags":["substrate","deformation","fibre-coordinate"],"leanRef":"qou:QOU.SubstrateParameter","text":"substrate-parameter.md","leanSource":"substrate-parameter.lean","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"def:substrate-parameter\"></a><p>The non-commutative de Rham complex carries two canonical endomorphisms: the full differential <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">d</code> and the vertical differential <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\pi_V \\circ d</code>. These span a one-parameter family of first-order operators:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-math math-display\">  d_q =  q^{-1}d +  (1 - q^{-1})\\pi_V \\circ d.</code></pre>\n<p>The <strong>substrate parameter</strong> <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">q \\in \\mathrm{End}(\\mathbf{1})</code> is the unique value for which <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">d_q</code> acts as <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">q^{-1}d</code> on horizontal forms and as <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">d</code> on vertical forms.</p>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/substrate-parameter.md","heading":"Definition","number":"4.7.5","page":"b/def-substrate-parameter","qa":{"counts":{"pass":88,"fail":2,"warn":0,"na":16,"unknown":0,"stale":81},"milnor":{"total":3,"notPassing":1}},"lean":{"expected":true,"ref":"qou:QOU.SubstrateParameter","via":"sibling","path":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/substrate-parameter.lean","compiles":"unchecked","sorry":false,"sorryBasis":"text"}}
